    <string-array name="engine_descs">
        <item>Sony hFT-Transformer (ISMIR 2023). Most accurate for solo piano, with velocity and live streaming while you record.</item>
        <item>Spotify Basic Pitch (ICASSP 2022). Tiny and very fast, works on voice, guitar, strings and other pitched instruments. Less precise on dense piano.</item>
        <item>Google MT3, piano checkpoint (ISMIR 2021). Sequence-to-sequence Transformer that writes notes and velocities directly. Slower; download 52 MB.</item>
        <item>Google MT3, multi-instrument checkpoint (ICLR 2022). Transcribes mixed instruments into notes; velocities are fixed. Slower; download 52 MB.</item>
    </string-array>
